ProjectQuack: PX4 platform for TypeFly (applies to typefly/TypeFly@ef1f5cc2555c8d2d2f9035516152baab66b924c4)

- llm_controller.py: robot_type "px4" -> typefly.platforms.px4_wrapper.PX4Wrapper
- webui.py: TYPEFLY_ROBOT_INFO picks the robot config file
- serving/yolo_service.py, yolo_client.py: TYPEFLY_YOLO_MODEL / _DEVICE / _TIMEOUT env vars; no MPS on Intel Macs
- platforms/px4_wrapper.py: shim re-exporting quackdrone.integrations.typefly_px4
- config/robot_info.px4.json: PX4 SITL robot config

Core edits by Eduardo Lozano (branch eduardo/px4-gazebo); TypeFly is Apache-2.0.
